flowchart TD
    Start([Raw Input Text]) --> Mask[Mask PII <br/>Emails, Phones]
    
    Mask --> Detect{Detect Language <br/>via langdetect}
    
    Detect -->|lang == 'en'| Passthrough[Bypass Translation]
    Detect -->|lang != 'en'| CheckCode{Is Supported <br/>by NLLB?}
    Detect -->|Exception/Too Short| Fail[Original Text Fallback]
    
    CheckCode -->|No| Passthrough
    CheckCode -->|Yes| Translate[Translate via NLLB-200]
    
    Translate --> |Success| Translated[Translated English Text]
    Translate --> |Fail| Fail
    
    Passthrough --> Analysis[Primary Prediction Pipeline]
    Translated --> Analysis
    Fail --> Analysis
    
    Analysis --> AttachMeta[Attach Translation Metadata & Original Text]
    AttachMeta --> End([JSON Output])
